# BRIDGE Modul X — environment configuration
#
# This build is a zero-configuration demo: the data layer is client-side
# (versioned localStorage, keys prefixed bx1_) and self-seeds on first load.
# NO variables are required to run, build, or test.
#
# When swapping src/lib/db.ts for the real FastAPI backend (reference repo),
# provide the following — never commit real values:

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1   # validator API base
# SUPABASE_URL=                                    # (backend only — never in frontend)
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=                       # (backend only — server-side, bypasses RLS)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=                                  # not used by this app; placeholder for reference-stack parity
